sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Classical Host / Optimizer
    participant M as NuXmv Monitor
    participant Q as Quantum Backend

    C->>M: S_INIT
    Note over C,M: iter := 0<br/>terms_done := 0<br/>params_ready = TRUE<br/>energy_ready = FALSE

    C->>M: BIND(theta_i)
    Note over M: circ_ready = TRUE<br/>params_ready = TRUE<br/>energy_ready = FALSE<br/>terms_done = 0

    M->>Q: EXECUTE_MEASURE(term 0, theta_i)
    Q-->>M: measurement_data[0]
    Note over M: terms_done := 1

    M->>Q: EXECUTE_MEASURE(term 1, theta_i)
    Q-->>M: measurement_data[1]
    Note over M: terms_done := 2

    M->>Q: EXECUTE_MEASURE(term N-1, theta_i)
    Q-->>M: measurement_data[N-1]
    Note over M: terms_done = NTERMS

    M->>C: COMPUTE_ENERGY
    Note over C,M: energy_i := EstimateEnergy(H, measurement_data)<br/>energy_ready = TRUE

    C->>M: CHECK_STOP
    Note over M: converged = FALSE<br/>iter < MAX_ITERS

    C->>M: OPTIMIZER_STEP
    Note over C,M: theta_{i+1} := OptimizerStep(theta_i, energy_i)<br/>iter := iter + 1

    C->>M: BIND(theta_{i+1})
    Note over M: params_ready = TRUE<br/>energy_ready = FALSE<br/>terms_done = 0

    M--xC: Rejected: qpu_error ignored in EXECUTE_MEASURE
    Note over M: Violates G((state = EXECUTE_MEASURE & qpu_error) -> X(state = ABORT))

    C--xM: Rejected: BIND with stale energy_ready = TRUE
    Note over M: Violates G((state = BIND & iter > 0) -> !energy_ready)

    M--xC: Rejected: COMPUTE_ENERGY when terms_done < NTERMS
    Note over M: Violates G(state = COMPUTE_ENERGY -> terms_done = NTERMS)

    C->>M: DONE
    DONE and ABORT are the terminal states
